message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cellscope"
abstract: "CellScope detects cell boundaries, tracks cells across frames, and quantifies migration, morphology, and edge dynamics — with support for both single-cell and multi-cell recordings. It provides a complete GUI-based workflow from raw recordings to publication-ready figures and statistical comparisons."
